{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49787","headline":"生查子 · 张泌","name":"生查子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相见稀，喜相见，相见还相远。\n檀画荔支红，金蔓蜻蜓輭。\n鱼雁疎，芳信断，花落庭阴晚。\n可惜玉肌肤，消瘦成慵嬾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}